ells pies at various locales, stalk him on FB or twitter or order a pie from his website. I sampled his key lime & peach pie slices last month. The key lime was a standout, tart and creamy and very satisfying. The peach was good but not as successful. I think maybe the peaches weren't perfectly ripe so the pie wasn't the super peach bomb that I wanted. Definitely worth hunting down."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
